{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GalactiBus is an online co-op bus driving simulator set in a wacky alien world. Team up as up to 4 players with friends or strangers. Keep the bus running, deliver your passengers \u201csafely\u201d and eliminate all threats along the way in this cosmic journey doomed to be disastrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bus Crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/extras/GBUS_270125_25001_S_ProtoGifs_A_01_ON01_ST_LS_600x190_EN.gif?t=1743581139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As part of the GalactiBus crew, your mission is simple: deliver alien passengers to their destinations. But things can get pretty chaotic in no time. One minute, you're driving; the next, you're stopping an alien passenger from starting a fire. Amid all the madness, teamwork is key. So communicate, adapt, and above all\u2014try not to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Vehicle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/extras/GBUS_270125_25001_S_ProtoGifs_A_03_ON01_ST_LS_600x190_EN.gif?t=1743581139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bus is the backbone of your operation. Keeping it functional is crucial. Expect the unexpected: flat tires, fuel shortages, full-blown engine meltdowns\u2026 the list goes on. It\u2019s up to you and your crew to stay on top of repairs and keep the wheels turning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Passenger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/extras/AD_4nXe2iagVIcJL0WkwyQzbLbt_Vthe4PeeSJF_b-CY0zYyvZx3nkmuYBsC9XYE_7DVYfRF2tAdVZMJlIdQs2Lc_aRtLiIEPjS-iWKEnqiyrBg04AqKad1vG_pMohW3u1oymSDBBliKQA.gif?t=1743581139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These alien passengers rely on the GalactiBus for their interplanetary travel. The more passengers you deliver (mostly) intact to their destinations, the more you earn. But keep a close eye on them. Sometimes these passengers can be\u2026a bit difficult or even cannibal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extra-terrestrial Threat</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/extras/AD_4nXe_fvXBEPvV3nUHWaoaVtUyQWW-JhJj6TWLU3VNkGVCrXxq5nCMUsQ2del1llI3wL8VcfEsUP9XjdmOKg1y4Ijaz44qyVPy9b-g-JTj3_LyT_fTQoIiMXX0LZNU40yh3Qavt78i.gif?t=1743581139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you step off the bus, you are on your own. Each planet has its own set of hostile creatures. Stay vigilant and gun down any menace coming your way to keep yourself and your passengers from becoming their next meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592800?t=1743581139","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/dd27bd137245c18fb4cfd5c2b282582e77d23694/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743581139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/e3c2fabc06ae7d324359b112b34aee0395c4e48d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743581139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/e3c2fabc06ae7d324359b112b34aee0395c4e48d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743581139","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GalactiBus is an online co-op bus driving simulator set in a wacky alien world. Team up as up to 4 players with friends or strangers. Keep the bus running, deliver your passengers \u201csafely\u201d and eliminate all threats along the way in this cosmic journey doomed to be disastrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bus Crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/extras/GBUS_270125_25001_S_ProtoGifs_A_01_ON01_ST_LS_600x190_EN.gif?t=1743581139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As part of the GalactiBus crew, your mission is simple: deliver alien passengers to their destinations. But things can get pretty chaotic in no time. One minute, you're driving; the next, you're stopping an alien passenger from starting a fire. Amid all the madness, teamwork is key. So communicate, adapt, and above all\u2014try not to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Vehicle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/extras/GBUS_270125_25001_S_ProtoGifs_A_03_ON01_ST_LS_600x190_EN.gif?t=1743581139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bus is the backbone of your operation. Keeping it functional is crucial. Expect the unexpected: flat tires, fuel shortages, full-blown engine meltdowns\u2026 the list goes on. It\u2019s up to you and your crew to stay on top of repairs and keep the wheels turning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Passenger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/extras/AD_4nXe2iagVIcJL0WkwyQzbLbt_Vthe4PeeSJF_b-CY0zYyvZx3nkmuYBsC9XYE_7DVYfRF2tAdVZMJlIdQs2Lc_aRtLiIEPjS-iWKEnqiyrBg04AqKad1vG_pMohW3u1oymSDBBliKQA.gif?t=1743581139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These alien passengers rely on the GalactiBus for their interplanetary travel. The more passengers you deliver (mostly) intact to their destinations, the more you earn. But keep a close eye on them. Sometimes these passengers can be\u2026a bit difficult or even cannibal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extra-terrestrial Threat</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/extras/AD_4nXe_fvXBEPvV3nUHWaoaVtUyQWW-JhJj6TWLU3VNkGVCrXxq5nCMUsQ2del1llI3wL8VcfEsUP9XjdmOKg1y4Ijaz44qyVPy9b-g-JTj3_LyT_fTQoIiMXX0LZNU40yh3Qavt78i.gif?t=1743581139\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you step off the bus, you are on your own. Each planet has its own set of hostile creatures. Stay vigilant and gun down any menace coming your way to keep yourself and your passengers from becoming their next meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Noodle Brain Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592800/49a6b96f8ee94077013d7e109bd564c0f2a0f447/header.jpg?t=1743581139","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113539,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113539/movie480.mp4?t=1743581138","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113539/movie_max.mp4?t=1743581138"},"name":"GalactiBus Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113539/3ef8d0dfbac00054d096e7b740b60f8ce13d9d1d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743581138","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113539/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743581138","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile